# Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values
# NEVER commit the .env file to git!
# Only shared/fred_client.py loads .env itself; for other collectors, export
# these into your shell. In CI they come from GitHub Secrets.

# Finnhub API Key (Get free key at: https://finnhub.io/register)
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_api_key_here

# FRED API Key (economy collectors, educationfacts)
# Get free key at: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
FRED_API_KEY=your_fred_api_key_here

# Alpaca market data (stockwhales, optionswhales, supportresistence)
# Create at: https://app.alpaca.markets/
ALPACA_API_KEY=your_alpaca_api_key_here
ALPACA_API_SECRET=your_alpaca_api_secret_here

# Alpha Vantage API Key (spgrowth fallback, etffundflows AUM/NAV)
# Get free key at: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your_alpha_vantage_api_key_here

# Financial Modeling Prep API Key (spgrowth fallback)
# Get key at: https://site.financialmodelingprep.com/developer/docs
FMP_API_KEY=your_fmp_api_key_here

# BLS and BEA API Keys (educationfacts)
# BLS: https://data.bls.gov/registrationEngine/  BEA: https://apps.bea.gov/API/signup/
BLS_API_KEY=your_bls_api_key_here
BEA_API_KEY=your_bea_api_key_here

# Google Search Console OAuth credentials (gsctopics)
GSC_CLIENT_ID=your_gsc_oauth_client_id_here
GSC_CLIENT_SECRET=your_gsc_oauth_client_secret_here
GSC_REFRESH_TOKEN=your_gsc_refresh_token_here

# GitHub Personal Access Token (Only needed for local testing of workflows)
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Permissions needed: repo (Full control of private repositories)
GITHUB_PAT=ghp_your_github_personal_access_token_here
